  "details": "# Issue:\n\nCurrently the \"Join\" button on the \"For You\" tab (as well as \"VRCat's Variety\" tab) brings you to a random public lobby when pressing it.\n\nThis button is quite likely to be clicked by accident when trying to drag scroll the page.\n\n# Expected Behaviour\n\nClicking on \"Join\" should open up a confirmation dialogue that would ideally also include information about what instance you are going to join. \n\nThis would prevent accidentally joining a random public and would additionally show you what kind of instance you are going to, before just sending you there.\n\nIt could say the following:\n\n```\n\nAre you sure you want to Join [world title]?\n\nDoing so wold bring you to [instance id + location flag] by [instance creator / group name] with [number of player in instance] / [max amount of players in world] [Friends In Instance].\n\nYES               NO\n\n```",
